        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T18:46:07.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:29.307Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "And CUDA 13.5 provides innovations across libraries, compilers, NVIDIA CUDA Tile , and developer tools.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-cuda-13-5-brings-nvidia-vera-rubin-ga-support/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T18:46:07.000Z",
