        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T18:46:07.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-06T17:28:29.307Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Core CUDA math libraries in CUDA 13.5 now have performance improvements on Vera Rubin. cuBLAS extends Ozaki-II scheme to FP64 symmetric rank-k updates.",
