      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Faster GEMMs on NVIDIA Vera Rubin: Updated heuristics and kernel tuning improve out-of-the-box NVFP4 and MXFP8 matmul performance on Vera Rubin, including mixture-of-experts (MoE) LLM training shapes.",
